  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dilshad Begam vs The Commissioner on 17 October, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.30 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 17.10.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.30404 of 2024 Dilshad Begam .... Petitione Vs 1.The Commissioner, Greater Chennai Corporation, Ripon Building, Poonamallee High Road, Chennai-600 003. 2.The 13th Zonal Officer, Greater Chennai Corporation, Kasturba Nagar, 31 Thiruvenkadam Street, Bakshavasalam Nagar, Adyar, Chennai-600 020. 3.The Assistant Revenue Officer, 115, Dr.Muthulakshmi Salai, Chennai-600 020. .... Responden Prayer:- Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of I the issuance of Writ of Mandamus, direction to the 2nd respondent t remove the lock and seal order dated 28.06.2022 and consequently ha over the vacant possession. Page 1 of 5 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No Dilshad Begam vs The Commissioner on 17 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/56137457/ 1 For Petitioner : Dr.R.Vinu Priyanga For Respondents : Mrs.P.T.Ramadevi Standing Counsel Order",
    "facts": "The petitioner was engaged a business in the name and style of M/s.J.J.MEE Foods at Door No.13/06, Velayutha Raja Street, Mandaveli, Chennai 600 028. Though the petitioner was initially issued a license, subsequently, it was revoked on the ground that the petitioner failed to follow the safety measures and also sanitary regulations, since the local residents of the street objected to the manufacturing of noodles by the petitioner in the said premises. The petitioner submitted an application for a fresh license and the same was https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis not considered. Now, the petitioner decided to close down the business and utilise the premises for personal purposes. Therefore, the petitioner submitted a representation to remove the lock and seal on the premises at Door No.13/06, Velayutha Raja Street, Mandaveli, Chennai 600 028. 4.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
